Christmas gift for me.
正好作为我的圣诞礼物。

1319
01:04:04.210 --> 01:04:04.910
Earmark that.
把它标记出来。

1320
01:04:06.250 --> 01:04:08.570
Survival and emergency kits and products.
生存和应急工具包及产品。

1321
01:04:08.750 --> 01:04:08.950
Jenna.
珍娜。

1322
01:04:09.530 --> 01:04:11.110
We'll see you next week, everyone.
大家，我们下周见。

1323
01:04:11.350 --> 01:04:12.310
See you next week.
下周见。

